308_r0_l02 the stores etc. and to be under the same directions
308_r0_l03 as before ordered. so soon as the stores arrive you
308_r0_l04 are with all pofsible dispath to procure a suf -
308_r0_l05 ficient number of waggons to carry them to win -
308_r0_l06 chester; whither they are to be sent under the
308_r0_l07 escort of the soldiers now heres: except the suits
308_r0_l08 of clothes; shoes stocking shirts etc. proportiona -
308_r0_l09 bly which are to be left with colonel carlyle.
308_r0_l10 you are to be very careful of all the
308_r0_l11 things delivered into the waggons and see that
308_r0_l12 a strict guard is kept over them that no embez -
308_r0_l13 zlement is made. if your men can not be
308_r0_l14 conveniently quartered on their march up; there
308_r0_l15 will be a number of tents among the stores which
308_r0_l16 must be made use of. - if any of the soldiers
308_r0_l17 should desert from this place - it would be proper
308_r0_l18 to send a sergeant and one or two trusty men
308_r0_l19 in pursuit of them.
